&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Peki, yılın ilk 6 ayında kesilen para cezalarının toplam tutarı ne kadar biliyor musunuz?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

